[
  {
    "id": "patterns-against-distance",
    "title": "Patterns Against Distance",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "three bodies suspended",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in arrangements older than language",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and somehow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I still thought they meant something",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I kept drawing lines between them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as though the universe",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "had placed them there for me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe alignment is only visible",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "from one precise place,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "at one precise moment",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "before everything drifts apart again",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I see you now",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "though maybe not tomorrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "this year,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but maybe not the next",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "our lives crossing briefly",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "until somewhere further ahead—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "time pulls us back",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "into the same line again",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "in the impossible geometry",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of being alive at once",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "here we are",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "aligned",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in time,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in space",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#patterns-against-distance"
  },
  {
    "id": "polaroids",
    "title": "Polaroids",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "polaroids",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i hang them on my wall",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i look at each of them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and wonder",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "if i could travel through them all",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "as if every photograph",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "were somewhere",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could still return to",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "sometimes i wish",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i could grow tired of these memories",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but memories always have a way",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of coming back to me",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“i’ll be back soon,”",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i said",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "“pinky promise,”",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i said",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe i’ll come back one day",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "maybe i won’t",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "maybe i keep going back",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "just to live a little longer",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in the way things used to be",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "even when they cannot",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "come back to me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#polaroids"
  },
  {
    "id": "i-miss",
    "title": "I miss",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the sunsets",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when the clouds appeared their prettiest",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "warm colours bleeding into one another",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how they gave me emotions",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and memories of a home",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the smell",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of honey and lavender",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on walks with my sister",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "past the houses of neighbours",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "whose streets i still remember",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss walking home from school",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with the friends i loved most",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the one friend",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "who carried all the things",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i was too afraid",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to carry alone",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the friends i made",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "just before leaving",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how cruel it was",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "a hello could arrive late,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "with goodbye already",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "waiting at the door",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss how slowly the days passed",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "how quickly the years went by",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss the times i had them all,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i miss.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#i-miss",
    "sourceImage": {
      "src": "/images/poetry/i-miss.jpeg",
      "alt": "Clouds over a quiet intersection at sunset."
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "the-stars-do-not-know",
    "title": "The stars do not know",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "we’ve heard about the stars.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "we’ve even named them.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but the stars don’t know us—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they don’t know me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they don’t even know my name.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i guess then, that means",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "i cannot exist without the stars,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "but the stars continue to exist",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "without me.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#the-stars-do-not-know"
  },
  {
    "id": "see-through",
    "title": "See-through",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "Through her eyes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they can see",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the universe",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "expa n d  i n     g",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Through her eyes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they can see",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "whole lakes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "pouring",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Through her eyes",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "I can see",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "what they cannot",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "and",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "when she doesn’t blink",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "it’s as if",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the fires started flaming",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#see-through"
  },
  {
    "id": "the-passage-of-time",
    "title": "Passage of Time",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "time is just an illusion",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "an empty space",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "we mistake for distance",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "aging is just memories",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of sad and happy days,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "all passing",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and somehow still here",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "death is just the start of life,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "another beginning",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "we cannot yet see",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but time is an illusion—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "it keeps us awake,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "teaches us to count",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "what cannot be kept,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "while memories fade",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "so cherish this moment",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as if it were the last",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "nor the first",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "because",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "time",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "just",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "an",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "illusion",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 3
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#the-passage-of-time"
  },
  {
    "id": "how-will-i-know",
    "title": "How Will I Know",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "how will i know they’ll always be,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when will i know my time will be?",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "in wuthering days i wallow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "nor trouble the morrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "yet here i am,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "twenty steps forward,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "nineteen steps back,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as though the one between",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "might spare me sorrow.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "how will i know the love will be",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when gone,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "they’ll wait for me?",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "how will i know my love will be",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "when distance calls—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "will my heart still be?",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "so onward you have to go",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "onward is all you know",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "(backwards is all i know)",
          "italic": true,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "regardless of what follows",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "soon enough, it will be known",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "and soon the sorrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "will be overshadowed",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "love beyond its means",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "care beyond the horizons",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "only that no heart",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "was made to hold",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the whole of tomorrow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "you’ll find solitude",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in what you quest for",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "in what you call unknown",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "soon you shall discover",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "they will always be,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "you will always be.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
    "source": "https://sarakim23.vercel.app/writing/poetry#how-will-i-know"
  },
  {
    "id": "there-is-grace-in-the-unknown",
    "title": "There is Grace in the Unknown",
    "stanzas": [
      [
        {
          "text": "i waited",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "within that frail country called hope,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "without knowledge",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "beneath the cloudless breadth of blue",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "still,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "there i lay,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "low beneath the hours,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 2
        },
        {
          "text": "while hollow feet moved through the halls",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "and demanded a truth",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "in waiting",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "midst the unkown",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "i turned the waves beneath his keel",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "one hundred and eight",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "stood already at the threshold of hades",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "finite knowledge is a kind of grace",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "it descends upon the fertile earth",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and crowns a woman queen",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "over what she can endure,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "over the dead below",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the blessed fields beyond them",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "but knowledge without end",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "would drown each lesser mercy—",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "misery, shame, and guilt",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "would rise like bubbles from the deep,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "while every hollow left by the unknown",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "grew vaster than the sea",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "so beauty returned",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "to the blessedness of waiting",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for waiting was loyalty",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "then the loom fell still",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "the sea withheld no more",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "in waiting,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "having kept its oath",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "became knowing.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ]
    ],
