        {
          "text": "the blue earth’s shadow",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I glimmered through the waters,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "as though I moved in quiet accord",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "from dear Titan Selene",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "for meek and gentle tides.",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Soon I became unaware",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of the path I was taking,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "lost in that monochrome",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of blue, grey, and black",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "Slowly, I was taken in",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "by the beauty",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "of those vast blue sheets,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "by the glimmers of moonlight",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "and the stars that danced",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "on the sharp crests of the waves",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        }
      ],
      [
        {
          "text": "I wandered through the sea",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "until I had gone so far",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "that I became a tiny creature",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "meaningless,",
          "italic": false,
          "indent": 0
